      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const clips = $input.first().json.data;\nconst videoTitle = $('Klap: Get Status').first().json.name || 'your video';\nconst base = 'N8N_BASE_URL/webhook/client-slug-shorts-approve';\nconst items = clips.map(c => {\n  const q = `?clip=${c.id}&folder=${c.folder_id}`;\n  const score = c.virality_score ?? 'n/a';\n  const name = c.name || ('Clip ' + String(c.id).slice(0, 6));\n  return `\n    <div style=\"border:1px solid #e1e4e8; border-radius:10px; padding:16px; margin:14px 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;\">\n      <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 6px; font-size:16px;\">${name}</h3>\n      <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px; color:#586069; font-size:13px;\">Virality: <strong>${score}</strong></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;\"><a href=\"https://klap.app/player/${c.id}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#0366d6; text-decoration:none;\">> Preview clip</a></p>\n      <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n        <td><a href=\"${base}${q}&action=approve\" style=\"display:inline-block; background:#0a7d4f; color:#fff; padding:9px 16px; border-radius:6px; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600; font-size:14px;\">Approve</a></td>\n        <td style=\"padding:0 6px;\"></td>\n        <td><a href=\"${base}${q}&action=regenerate\" style=\"display:inline-block; background:#d97706; color:#fff; padding:9px 16px; border-radius:6px; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600; font-size:14px;\">Regenerate</a></td>\n        <td style=\"padding:0 6px;\"></td>\n        <td><a href=\"${base}${q}&action=skip\" style=\"display:inline-block; background:#6a737d; color:#fff; padding:9px 16px; border-radius:6px; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600; font-size:14px;\">Skip</a></td>\n      </tr></table>\n    </div>`;\n}).join('');\n\nconst wrapper = `<!doctype html><html><body style=\"margin:0; padding:24px; background:#f6f8fa; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif; color:#24292e;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width:680px; margin:0 auto; background:#ffffff; border-radius:14px; padding:28px;\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 14px; font-size:15px;\">Alright - Klap just generated <strong>${clips.length}</strong> short clip${clips.length === 1 ? '' : 's'} from <em>${videoTitle}</em>.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 18px; font-size:15px;\">Click a button on each card to Approve / Regenerate / Skip. Approvals go straight into the publish pipeline; Regenerate triggers a fresh Klap run; Skip just logs it.</p>\n    ${items}\n    <p style=\"margin:24px 0 0; color:#6a737d; font-size:12px;\">Or reply to this email with free text (e.g. \"approve clip 1 and 3, skip the rest\") - the Gemini agent will parse it.</p>\n  </div>\n</body></html>`;\n\nreturn [{ json: {\n  clip_list_html: items,\n  email_html: wrapper,\n  video_title: videoTitle,\n  client_slug: 'client-slug',\n  clip_count: clips.length,\n}}];\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Notify Client → Review (Gmail)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        2592,
        -48
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "REPLACE_WITH_CLIENT_EMAIL",
        "subject": "=[client-slug Shorts Review] {{ $json.video_title }} - {{ $json.clip_count }} clip{{ $json.clip_count === 1 ? '' : 's' }} ready",
        "message": "={{ $json.email_html }}",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false,
          "senderName": "YCAT Shorts"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Sticky: Per-client onboarding (5 steps)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -816,
        544
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Per-client onboarding (5 minutes)\n\n1. **Gmail filter** in YCAT Gmail (`you@example.com`):\n   - Matches: `from:<client@email> to:shorts@example.com`\n   - Action: Apply label `client:<slug>`, Skip Inbox\n\n2. **Save As Copy** of this template → rename `[YCAT/<Client>] YT Long-Form to Shorts`\n\n3. **In the copy**, search/replace `client-slug` → client's slug (e.g. `acme`).\n   This affects: Gmail Trigger label filter, Notify Client URLs, webhook paths.\n\n4. **Wire credentials in the copy**:\n   - Gmail Trigger → assign YCAT Gmail OAuth credential (you create once)\n   - Verify Sender → set expected from-address to `client@example.com`\n   - YouTube node → assign client's YouTube OAuth credential\n   - Notify Client → replace `REPLACE_WITH_LOOPS_TEMPLATE_ID` (Loops review template ID)\n                   → replace `REPLACE_WITH_CLIENT_EMAIL` (client's email)\n   - (optional) Klap → swap to client's Klap key in production\n\n5. **Repeat for the approval workflow copy** (also has `client-slug` placeholders + a webhook path).\n\n6. **Activate both workflows.**\n\nStrangers can never trigger anything: their from-address won't match any Gmail filter, so no label is applied, so no workflow's Gmail Trigger sees the message.",
        "height": 700,
        "width": 1100,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Dedupe: Skip Already-Seen Videos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.removeDuplicates",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -48,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "removeItemsSeenInPreviousExecutions",
        "dedupeValue": "={{ $json.youtube_url }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    }
